{
  "notes": "Curated cases for the consumer defective-goods/deficient-service scenario (Consumer Protection Act, 2019). Each case runs the actual Pydantic validator + clause-selector + citation-resolution + forum-tier pipeline in complaint_drafter.py -- nothing here is mocked. Forum-tier thresholds: District <= Rs. 50 lakh, State Rs. 50 lakh - Rs. 2 crore, National > Rs. 2 crore, per the Consumer Protection (Jurisdiction ...) Rules, 2021 (Rules 3-5), which are the values actually in force today under the Act's own delegated proviso power in Sections 34(1)/47(1)(a)(i)/58(1)(a)(i) -- not the Act's bare original figures of Rs. 1 crore / Rs. 10 crore.",
  "cases": [
